{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X个别感受意象过于具体甚至跳跃，例如“年少时初恋的下午”“多年后走进旧房子”，容易让观众从人物当下的心理转去琢磨比喻；Y的叙事文字则更连贯、自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用重点放大和话语、感受交替的排法，让观众很快抓住每段人物心理的转折，尤其是“害怕负担”“不敢坦白”“害怕失去”“不再隐藏”等关键动机，因果关系比较容易扫出来。它的感受文字又有较多与音乐进程对应的具体声音、身体和环境细节，能让人感到情绪如何发生变化，而不只是知道人物高兴或难过。Y的完整叙事更顺滑，但右侧感受容易成为一组并列的情绪标签，X在重点识别和感受层次上更有优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "acc79e8a-a126-447c-8ee3-f4ed38ad6f37", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T005100493341Z", "elapsed_seconds": 82.407, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:52:22.923435+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0c4e6c22175a7b51f4f1dcd059170f5d19b1bd72bb7136359032850283f8202d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683